		"item_harmonizer_desc": "All equipped weapons get one Evolution level.",
		"item_immortality": "Immortality",
		"item_immortality_desc_v2": "If your Main Weapon is about to be destroyed, it will be reduced to 1 health instead. This ability can only be used once every 2 minutes.",
		"item_immortality_desc_2": "If your Main Weapon is about to be destroyed, it will be reduced to 1 health instead, and all enemies within 400 metres of the main weapon will be dealt lethal Kinetic damage. This ability can only be used once every 2 minutes.",
